# MAS working contract

Read `AGENTS.md` first (map, invariants, recipes, traps). The queue of work is `MAS_REFACTORING_PLAN.md` → «Ближайшие шаги».

## Scope
- One plan item (or one user request) per session. Do the whole item; do not widen or quietly narrow it. Extra findings → a line in the plan's debt table, not a change.
- Never touch `n8n/templates/retired/`, `n8n/workflows/retired/`, golden `*_MAS_result.INC`, or wipe cases unless the user asked.

## Evidence before fixes
- A live defect is reproduced with `python3 scripts/mas_trace_case.py CASE-… --n8n` (timeline, state, human-text audit, n8n executions) before any edit. Quote the event/node that proves the cause.
- Do not "fix" Qwen behaviour by adding regex or hardcoded routes — change the prompt/tool contract or add a deterministic *guard*, and prove it on a live case.

## Change discipline
- Source of truth is `n8n/templates/*.py` and the FastAPI code. After editing a template: `cd n8n/templates && python3 generate_<x>.py` (`generate_schedule_workflows.py` for RAG/schedule). Never edit workflow JSON by hand.
- Every fixed defect gets a regression test (pytest or `n8n/tests/*-smoke.js`) with the case id in its docstring.
- Human-facing text (HITL questions, options, `status_message`, summaries) is Russian prose without snake_case / `key=value` / JSON / `a|b` — both services validate this via `human_text_problems`; keep file and sheet names out of `message`, put them in `data`.

## Gate = definition of done
- `python3 scripts/mas_gate.py` (regen drift, 16 smokes, 5 pytest suites, offline combat) must be GREEN before reporting.
- If orchestrator, an agent, prompts, emit or Activity artifacts were touched: `python3 scripts/mas_gate.py --live` → 12/12 `done` (six `run_live_five` + `demo_agent_long_job` + `three_agent_chain` + `excel_datasets` + three recovery), `mismatch_count: 0`, no repeated HITL, no `completion_review` escalation. Lab only: needs Docker Compose + `.env`.
- Report facts: files, counts, case ids, what is not done and why. No "should work".

## Close the loop
- Update `MAS_REFACTORING_PLAN.md`: debt row + «Ревизия N» with live findings. After that, **current slices must match code** — header revision number (= last §7 entry), §3 «Состояние», §4 current-gate paragraph, §2.7, «Ближайшие шаги». Do not leave §3/§4 labeled with an older revision. Journal §7 and closed-phase criteria stay as written.
- `docs.md` / `AGENTS.md` when a contract, command or field step changed (including `--live` case count).
- Temporary scripts live in `/tmp`, not in the repo.
